{"3514670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Serious Golf", "steam_appid": 3514670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/36122434cc6d5e78daec8bd1aeb1409f.avif?t=1776096177\" width=616 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Super Serious Golf</i></strong> where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Terrible at golf? Great! Hit your ball as hard as you can, hope for the best and watch the madness unfold in a series of easy-to-learn minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/502e13b9803ff7ee61285ee5d95e0a86.poster.avif?t=1776096177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/502e13b9803ff7ee61285ee5d95e0a86.webm?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/502e13b9803ff7ee61285ee5d95e0a86.mp4?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/c51fb2816f70dbf9db7c482b3fd5316f.avif?t=1776096177\" width=616 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of having too many friends? Battle it out in <strong>8 player lobbies</strong> and watch friendships fall apart. <strong>Bots can also be added </strong>to make the chaos even more... chaotic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ec90735c119d5e6df2c02ea5a8f24f2.poster.avif?t=1776096177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ec90735c119d5e6df2c02ea5a8f24f2.webm?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/3ec90735c119d5e6df2c02ea5a8f24f2.mp4?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/e60ce21a3c6e25ab3c160fb84cabddc3.avif?t=1776096177\" width=616 height=168 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle it out in a generous amount of <strong>simple</strong> <strong>minigames</strong> and show off your style with a large collection of <strong>unique hats and trails</strong> that are all earned through gameplay. None of those pesky microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/71a0c078981f5b9ebc7f6fff6461f722.poster.avif?t=1776096177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/71a0c078981f5b9ebc7f6fff6461f722.webm?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/71a0c078981f5b9ebc7f6fff6461f722.mp4?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple, easy to understand gameplay.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private and public lobbies with up to 8 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of minigames and cosmetics to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mode selection to change up how minigames are played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect interesting powerups to  tip the scales of each game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bots to fill out lobbies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/89c7d9570d96c7d3653f3e9fa93bdc5d.poster.avif?t=1776096177\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/89c7d9570d96c7d3653f3e9fa93bdc5d.webm?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/89c7d9570d96c7d3653f3e9fa93bdc5d.mp4?t=1776096177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514670/extras/36122434cc6d5e78daec8bd1aeb1409f.avif?t=1776096177\" width=616 height=244 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>Super Serious Golf</i></strong> where shot count and accuracy goes out the window. Terrible at golf? Great! Hit your ball as hard as you can, hope for the best and watch the madness unfold in a series of easy-to-learn minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"http